;. /grove_source_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition grove_source
  ;= Author a Grove source proposal
    This flow returns native values. Use the retain_result writer for a standalone occurrence. Compose project_result when a Nenex document is wanted. Publish the named child flows before publishing this composition; their exact definitions are captured.

    ;@ /flow/input sources
    ;= sources

    ;@ /flow/input provider
    ;= provider

    ;@ /flow/step task ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/grove_source
    ;@ /flow/bind pages document
    ;@ /flow/bind sources sources
    ;@ /flow/bind context sources
    ;= task

    ;@ /flow/step answered ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/interactive_requests
    ;@ /flow/bind tasks task
    ;@ /flow/bind provider provider
    ;= answered

    ;@ /flow/step proposal ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/results
    ;@ /flow/bind responses answered
    ;= proposal

    ;@ /flow/result proposal
    ;= Author a Grove source proposal result

    ;@ /flow/page /
    ;= Author a Grove source proposal
      Read the app requirements and Grove syntax in the supplied sources. Return an unused draft name, complete Grove source and a note explaining design decisions or missing information. Reuse native roles, records, codecs, views and declared actions. Do not create, save, compile or publish anything in this stage. Missing domain requirements leave the work hole unresolved. This result is source to compile, not evidence of a working app.
